        "bookingUrl": "https://www.booking.com/hotel/no/wangen-apartments-as.fr.html?aid=304142&label=gen173nr-10CAQoggJCC3NlYXJjaF9mbGFtSA1YBGhNiAEBmAEzuAEXyAEM2AED6AEB-AEBiAIBqAIBuAL6pMPPBsACAdICJDQwOTE0OWJlLTU3YzktNGRjZC1iMGUzLWJiOTliYWYwNzk5ZtgCAeACAQ&ucfs=1&arphpl=1&checkin=2026-07-15&checkout=2026-07-16&group_adults=2&req_adults=2&no_rooms=1&group_children=0&req_children=0&hpos=1&hapos=1&sr_order=popularity&nflt=review_score%3D90&srpvid=ec346cfd66170137&srepoch=1777390206&all_sr_blocks=941973509_366418713_2_0_0_375687&highlighted_blocks=941973509_366418713_2_0_0_375687&matching_block_id=941973509_366418713_2_0_0_375687&sr_pri_blocks=941973509_366418713_2_0_0_375687_847341&from=searchresults",
